From: MrUnforsaken
Date: 2026-05-25
Subject: [PATCH 0012] Wire advanced config into face AS, IR, and auth

Pass advanced config parameters through to the actual usage sites:
- FaceAntiSpoofing: configurable unsharp mask enable/amount + spoof class index
- IR capture: warmup_frames, timeout, poll_interval, max_attempts, agc_sleep, camera_warmup
- FaceAuth: use IR params from config, getMaxAuthTimeMs() implementation
- AntiSpoofCheck: combinational_mode (all/any), pass IR params + unsharp + spoof class

